{"output": "The inverse of the product $\mathbf{A} \mathbf{B}$ is given by the property $(\mathbf{A} \mathbf{B})^{-1} = \mathbf{B}^{-1} \mathbf{A}^{-1}$. Using the provided matrices $\mathbf{A}^{-1} = \begin{pmatrix} 4 & 0 \\ 1 & -1 \end{pmatrix}$ and $\mathbf{B}^{-1} = \begin{pmatrix} 2 & -1 \\ -1 & 3 \end{pmatrix}$, we compute:

$$
